<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title
      >TACL-LYF Camp {{campYear}} Registration Confirmation for
      {{camperName}}</mj-title
    >
    <mj-preview
      >TACL-LYF Camp {{campYear}} Registration Confirmation for
      {{camperName}}</mj-preview
    >
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all
        font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
      ></mj-all>
      <mj-text
        font-weight="400"
        font-size="16px"
        color="#000000"
        line-height="24px"
        font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
      ></mj-text>
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          src="{{#emailHeaderImageUrl}}{{emailHeaderImageUrl}}{{/emailHeaderImageUrl}}{{^emailHeaderImageUrl}}https://mcusercontent.com/723f6baf2c99017f0ff638067/_compresseds/e3a31227-4ec5-6864-fb06-6cf57a124b1c.jpg{{/emailHeaderImageUrl}}"
        ></mj-image>

        <mj-text font-size="24px" font-family="helvetica" font-weight="bold"
          >Thank you for registering for TACL-LYF Camp {{campYear}}!</mj-text
        >

        <mj-text
          ><strong>{{camperName}}</strong> is successfully registered for the
          <strong>{{campTrack}}</strong> camp track!</mj-text
        >

        <mj-text
          >We'll be sending more updates on camp through email, the TACL LYF
          <a href="https://lin.ee/8zWlnfM">LINE chat</a>, as well as our
          socials, so make sure to follow us on all platforms for the most
          up-to-date information! Our registration, cancellation, and health
          policies can be found on our
          <a href="https://lyf.tacl.org/camp/registration-policy/">website</a>.
          Feel free to reach out to lyf@tacl.org with any questions or visit our
          <a href="https://lyf.tacl.org/camp/faqs/">website FAQs</a>!</mj-text
        >

        <mj-text>We look forward to seeing you at camp!</mj-text>

        <mj-text
          >Here is a copy of your responses:
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Name:</strong> {{camperName}}</li>
            <li><strong>Preferred Name:</strong> {{camperPreferredName}}</li>
            <li><strong>Birthday:</strong> {{camperBirthday}}</li>
            <li><strong>Grade:</strong> {{camperGrade}}</li>
            <li><strong>Gender:</strong> {{camperGender}}</li>
            <li><strong>Pronouns: </strong>{{camperPronouns}}</li>
            <li><strong>T-Shirt Size (Adult):</strong> {{camperTShirtSize}}</li>
            <li><strong>Cabin:</strong> {{camperCabinPreference}}</li>
            <li><strong>Diet/Food Restrictions:</strong> {{camperDietFood}}</li>
            <li><strong>Medical:</strong> {{camperMedical}}</li>
            <li>
              <strong>Additional Notes:</strong> {{camperAdditionalNotes}}
            </li>
          </ul>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text
          >View or edit your registration using your
          <a href="https://lyf-registration.tacl.org/user/profile/"
            >registration dashboard</a
          ></mj-text
        >
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          src="https://mcusercontent.com/723f6baf2c99017f0ff638067/images/6189858c-5375-fad9-b62c-3cee7ba86086.jpg"
        ></mj-image>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-divider
          padding="0"
          border-color="lightgrey"
          border-width="2px"
        ></mj-divider>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#404040">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#F2F2F2" align="center"
          >Taiwanese American Citizens League - Leading Youth Forward | TACL-LYF
          is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization through its parent organization
          Taiwanese American Citizens League.</mj-text
        >
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-social align="center">
          <mj-social-element
            src="https://cdn-images.mailchimp.com/icons/social-block-v2/color-facebook-48.png"
            href="https://www.facebook.com/tacl.lyf/"
          ></mj-social-element>

          <mj-social-element
            src="https://cdn-images.mailchimp.com/icons/social-block-v2/color-instagram-48.png"
            href="https://www.instagram.com/tacllyf/"
          ></mj-social-element>

          <mj-social-element
            src="https://cdn-images.mailchimp.com/icons/social-block-v2/color-link-48.png"
            name="link"
            href="https://lin.ee/8zWlnfM"
          ></mj-social-element>
        </mj-social>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
